              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omusaadha mwene ndhu yaafuluma, yaabakoba ati: “Bakagwa, mbeeghembye mutakola kiive kyaga agho. Omusaadha ono, mugeni wange. Mutakola kikolwa kya budankaanu ekyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bona, ghaligho mukazi we ni mughala wange omwegha. Ka nfulumye abo mpegaano, mubakole kyonakyona kye mwenda. Aye omusaadha ono mutamukolaku kya budankaanu kyaga agho!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye abasaadha baaloba kumuwulirisa. Kale omusaadha yaagema mukazi we yaamufulumya ye bali. Baamukaka baaba naye era baamukolaku ebintu ebibi obwire bwonabwona okutuusa enkyo. Baamuleka yaaja nga buli kukya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho obwire nga buli kukya, omukazi yaidha yaagwa agho gha mulyango gw'endhu y'omusaadha omukaire omwali iba, yaaba agho okutuusa lwe bwakyera irala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iba bwe yasitukagho ku nkyo, yaigulagho olwigi ng'ayenda okugolola ewuwe. Yaja okulinga ati, ng'abona mukazi we agwire agho gha mulyango gw'endhu, emikono gye nga girikughaaniriza olwigi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaamukoba ati: “Situka tuje.” Aye ng'omukazi tali kumwiramu. Agho yaamuta ku ndogoyi, yaagolola ewuwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe yatuuka eka yaingira mu ndhu ye, yaatoolayo akambe, yaagema omulambo gwa mukazi we yaagusalasalamu ebitundu ikumi na bibiri, buli kika kya Isiraeli yaakigheerezaaku ekitundu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.11.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 11:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho boonaboona abaabona ekyo baakoba bati: “Ekintu ng'oti n'ekyo tikibangaghooku era tikibonebwangaku bukyanga Baisiraeli bava mu Misiri. Mukirowoozeeku, mukiteeseeku, tubone eky'okukola!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
